The engine in include/optimaru/ is a C++ reimplementation, with
modifications, of the Timefold Solver core: its architecture, package and
directory layout, class names, API and local-search framework are derived
from the Java originals. Some engine files instead implement algorithms
from the published literature or were written by optimaru (for example SISR
ruin-and-recreate and adaptive operator selection); every engine file
carries the same derivation header regardless.

